        "text": "RUTT/ETRA SCAN PROCESSOR (offline)\n1) LoadVideo luma \u2192 Z Push (Scan Studies = grayscale).\n2) Sine \u2192 Amp (slow LFO CV) \u2192 EnvelopeFollower \u2192 z_push_cv: hear the swell, see depth breathe.\n3) Soft oscs nudge X/Y. Left preview = source; right = scan.\n4) Inspector Look presets for other factory looks. Render, scrub."
